        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Best of the 'B' Sides, \"I Live My Way\", the A-side record, the film soundtrack\n- People: the film's star\n- Topics: song inclusion and exclusion, soundtrack identification\n\nFacts:\n- Best of the 'B' Sides excludes the song \"I Live My Way.\"\n- The A side of the record associated with \"I Live My Way\" was included on a film soundtrack.\n- The star of that film was born in March 1944.",
